WEBVTT

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.571
Some of you have been experimenting
with other strategies.

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:35.782
Woman to baby: Hey, bud,
can you say "welcome"?

00:12:35.806 --> 00:12:36.957
Baby: Welcome.

00:12:36.981 --> 00:12:38.132
Woman: To.
Baby: To.

00:12:38.156 --> 00:12:39.936
Woman: Principles.
Baby: (Babbles)

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.276
Woman: Of.
Baby: Of.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:43.689
Woman: Management!
Baby: (Babbles)

00:12:43.713 --> 00:12:44.889
Man: My little sister,

00:12:44.913 --> 00:12:47.766
she had found a sign that
said "Wall Street" on it.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:49.646
She put the Wall Street sign behind me

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:51.407
so that when I get on my Zoom calls,

00:12:51.431 --> 00:12:52.648
my colleagues can see it,

00:12:52.672 --> 00:12:54.874
and she said, "Look, now
you're on Wall Street.

00:12:54.898 --> 00:12:56.556
Stop complaining. Act like it."

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.066
Woman: Can you say "my"?
Baby: My

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.617
Woman: Mama.
Baby: Mama.